  "id": "neurodermatitis",
  "term": "neurodermatitis",
  "definition": "Neurodermatitis is a highly variable eczema-like skin condition thought to result from repeated scratching, rubbing, or pinching in response to intense itching. Its severity and appearance can differ widely between people, and some views describe it as having a psychogenic component; a localized form is often called lichen simplex chronicus.",
